@startuml
title VibeGraph Use Case Diagram

left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

actor "사용자" as User
actor "Apple Music API" as AppleMusic
actor "Neo4j Graph DB" as Neo4j
actor "OpenAI API" as OpenAI

rectangle "VibeGraph" {
  usecase "Apple Music 연결" as UC_Login
  usecase "플레이리스트 목록 조회" as UC_ListPlaylists
  usecase "분석할 플레이리스트 선택" as UC_SelectPlaylists
  usecase "플레이리스트 트랙 조회" as UC_ListTracks
  usecase "Graph DB 동기화" as UC_SyncGraph
  usecase "취향 분석 조회" as UC_AnalyzeTaste
  usecase "Graph 추천 후보 생성" as UC_GraphRecommend
  usecase "AI 추천 이유 생성" as UC_Explain
  usecase "Apple Music 플레이리스트 생성" as UC_CreatePlaylist
  usecase "오류 확인 및 재시도" as UC_Retry
}

User --> UC_Login
User --> UC_ListPlaylists
User --> UC_SelectPlaylists
User --> UC_SyncGraph
User --> UC_AnalyzeTaste
User --> UC_GraphRecommend
User --> UC_Explain
User --> UC_CreatePlaylist
User --> UC_Retry

UC_Login --> AppleMusic : MusicKit 인증
UC_ListPlaylists --> AppleMusic : /me/library/playlists
UC_ListTracks --> AppleMusic : /me/library/playlists/{id}/tracks
UC_SyncGraph ..> UC_ListTracks : <<include>>
UC_SyncGraph --> Neo4j : User/Playlist/Track/Artist/Genre 저장
UC_AnalyzeTaste --> Neo4j : Artist/Genre 집계
UC_GraphRecommend --> Neo4j : 관계 탐색
UC_Explain --> OpenAI : 추천 이유 JSON 생성
UC_CreatePlaylist --> AppleMusic : /me/library/playlists

note right of UC_SyncGraph
  현재 userId는 user_default로
  고정 사용 가능.
  향후 다중 사용자 인증으로 확장.
end note

note bottom of UC_GraphRecommend
  현재 추천은 상위 장르 기반 탐색.
  SIMILAR_TO, PageRank, Node2Vec은 확장 후보.
end note

@enduml
